T_j \text{ unmet} \;\not\Rightarrow\; \text{halt}(T_i); \quad \text{instead} \;\Rightarrow\; \text{fallback}(T_i \mid T_j).

Rule 5.3 (Shared-gate review). At proposed three-year workshops, all tracks pass SF1–SF9 review simultaneously. Failure in one track triggers that track's fallback, not a global halt.

